------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Project:  https://github.com/obra/superpowers
   Copyright (c) 2025 Jesse Vincent
   License:  MIT License

   The skills/systematic-debugging and skills/test-driven-development
   directories under skills/ are copies of the corresponding directories
   in the superpowers project. The modifications are limited to:

   - a single added `display_name` line in each SKILL.md YAML frontmatter
     (providing the local skill display name);
   - two rewritten cross-references in skills/systematic-debugging/SKILL.md
     that pointed at skills from the upstream plugin by their namespaced
     names: one now names the sibling skill shipped here, the other pointed
     at a skill that is not distributed with this product and has been
     reworded to state the requirement itself;
   - one removed parenthetical cross-reference of the same kind in
     skills/test-driven-development/writing-good-tests.md.

   No other content was changed. The full MIT license text is bundled at
   skills/systematic-debugging/LICENSE and skills/test-driven-development/LICENSE.

